  "doctrine": {
    "summary": "Large conscript army (18-month service) backed by a world-class defence industry, focused on deterring and fighting the KPA along the DMZ: massed K9 artillery and K239 rockets, mechanised corps with K2/K1A2 tanks and K21 IFVs, the 'Army TIGER' wheeled-mechanised brigades and strong ROK Marine Corps. Overseas: Cheonghae anti-piracy unit, UNIFIL (Dongmyeong unit, Lebanon) and Akh unit (UAE).",
    "squad_size": 9,
    "fireteam": "Rifle squad of 9-10 split into two fireteams with K15 LMG and K201 grenadiers. Game: 8 in four pairs.",
    "tactics": [
      "Counter-infiltration sweeps and DMZ guard-post defence",
      "Massed counter-battery fire with K9 and K239",
      "Mechanised combined arms with K2, K21 and K808 Army TIGER units",
      "Marine Corps amphibious landings with KAAV7 and Surion/Marineon helicopters",
      "Drone and counter-drone units (Drone Operations Command since 2023)"
    ],
